              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "AMO.1.6+AMO.1.7+AMO.1.8"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Am 1:6-8",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gaza hazohebga, Ashikeloni hahinduke imisaka: abo muri Ashidodi bazokwirukanwa ku murango w’amashōka, na Ekuroni hazorandurwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEP.2.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEP.2.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEP 2:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JOS.13.3"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yos 13:3",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EZK.25.16"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ezk 25:16",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bazobona ibara, ababa mu biyaya vyo ku kiyaga, ihanga ry’Abakereti! Ijambo ry’Uhoraho rirakujinjibuye, ewe Kanani, wa gihugu c’Abafilisitiya; azoguhonnya, ntihagire n’ umwe asigara akubamwo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEP.2.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEP.2.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEP 2:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ibiyaya vyo ku kiyaga bizosigara ar’ uburagiro gusa, har’ ibirāro vy’abungere n’impongore z’imikuku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEP.2.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEP.2.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEP 2:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ZEC.10.3"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Zek 10:3",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LUK.1.68"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Luk 1:68",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kand’ ivyo biyaya bizoba ivy’ amasigarira y’inzu ya Yuda; ni ho bazoragira; bgije biryamire mu mazu yo muri Ashikeloni; kuk’ Uhoraho Imana yabo azobagendera, ngw agarukane abajanywe ar’ inyagano. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEP.2.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEP.2.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEP 2:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JER.48.27"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yer 48:27",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EZK.25.3"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ezk 25:3",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ",",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EZK.25.6"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "6",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ati Numvise ibitutsi vya Mowabu, n’ugucokorana kw’Abamoni, bācokoye abantu banje, bakarya urubibe rwabo bihayagiza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEP.2.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEP.2.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEP 2:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.29.23"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Gus 29:23",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nuko rero, ndahiye ukubaho kwanje, ni k’Uhoraho Nyen’ ingabo agize, Imana y’Abisirayeli, n’ukuri Mowabu hazoba nk’i Sodomu, n’Abamoni nk’i Gomora, ah’ igisuru ciganziye, habe iyengo ry’imyunyu, hahinduke amatongo ibihe bidashira: amasigarira y’abantu banje azobatera abasahure, mber’ abarokotse bo mw ihanga ryanje bazobatwara. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEP.2.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEP.2.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEP 2:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ISA.16.6"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yes 16:6",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ivyo ni vyo bazosubirizwa mu nkōko kubg’ ubgibone bgabo, kuko bātuka abantu b’Uhoraho Nyen’ ingabo, bakabihayagizako. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEP.2.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEP.2.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEP 2:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "PSA.22.27"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Zab 22:27",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "MAL.1.11"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mal 1:11",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uhoraho azobabera agaterabgoba: kukw azocobogoza ibigirwamana vyose vyo kw isi; maz’ abantu bazomwunamira, umuntu wese ah’ ari, mbere n’ibizinga vyose vyo mu kiyaga vy’abanyamahanga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEP.2.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEP.2.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEP 2:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Namwe Banyetiyopiya n’uko, muzokwicwa n’inkota y’Uhoraho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEP.2.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEP.2.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEP 2:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ISA.10.12"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yes 10:12",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "NAM.3.7"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Nah 3:7",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kand’ azobangurira ukuboko kwiwe i burārūko, ageseze Ashuri; Ninewe ahahindure amatongo, hume nk’ikigatwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEP.2.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEP.2.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEP 2:14"
          },
          "items": [
