              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amasho azokwigaramangira hagati muri ho, n’ibikōko vyose vyo mw ishamba: inkongori n’ibinyogoto bizokwībēra ku bisapfu vy’amazu yaho: amajwi yavyo azokwumvikanira mu madirisha; mu rwinjiriro rw’imiryango yaho hazoba amasakamburira, kuko yasitaguye amagarwe y’imbaho z’amasederi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEP.2.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEP.2.14"
            ]
          }
        },
